stigations death threats made to kia  stammer following boris johnson's  comments about um jimmy savelle this is  what um keira's dumber said yesterday  just want to get your thoughts on this  the prime minister knew what he was  doing when he  introduced that slur  the other day  but this is not about me  there are threats to too many  politicians  particularly women actually  should the prime minister reconsider and  just say sorry  the prime minister did clarify his  remarks and of course  i deeply regret what happened uh to  kierstama  every politician needs to be able to go  about their job through without fear  that's that's very important but  ultimately it's the perpetrators who  attacked kearstarma who  verbally abused kierstarma who we should  be putting the blame on yeah pm darting  between cobra meetings heading up to  scotland going to the northwest the  northeast is leveling up traveling again  to europe um is he ever going to have  time to fill in this questionnaire for  the police  well he is fully cooperating  with the police inquiry but as you've  rightly said kay there is a very serious  situation at present  that we've been discussing with russia  and ukraine and the prime minister is  fully focused on that he will be  chairing a meeting of cobra  later this morning to make sure that we  are really pursuing the diplomacy that  we are pulling out all the stops on that  at the same time as preparing for the  worst and making sure we are in the best  possible position to respond alongside  our nato allies i wouldn't want to swap  places in your very elegant shoes this  morning uh foreign

